<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  {{> head title="긴급 출동 요청"}}
</head>
<body>
  {{> header}}

  <main class="page page-emergency">
    <div class="emergency-strip">
      <div class="container narrow">
        <p class="emergency-strip-label">24시간 365일 긴급출동</p>
        <h1 class="emergency-title"><span aria-hidden="true">🚨</span> 긴급 출동 요청</h1>
        <p class="emergency-lead">사진 1장과 연락처만 남겨주세요. 담당자가 바로 전화드립니다.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container narrow">
      <div class="call-card">
        <p class="call-card-title">전화가 가장 빠릅니다</p>
        <a class="btn btn-dark btn-lg btn-block" href="tel:16442667"><span aria-hidden="true">📞</span> 1644-2667 바로 전화</a>
      </div>

      <div class="first-aid">
        <p class="first-aid-title">지금 할 수 있는 응급조치</p>
        <ol>
          <li><strong>메인 밸브 잠그기</strong> 계량기 옆 수도 밸브를 잠가주세요</li>
          <li><strong>전기 멀리하기</strong> 누수 부위 아래 전기제품 · 콘센트를 치워주세요</li>
          <li><strong>물 받기</strong> 떨어지는 물 아래에 통을 두세요</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      {{#if error}}
        <div class="error-box" id="form-error" role="alert" tabindex="-1">
          <strong>접수되지 않았어요</strong>
          <p>{{error}}</p>
        </div>
      {{/if}}

      <form id="report-form" class="report-form" action="/emergency" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data">
        <section class="form-card">
          <h2 class="form-card-title"><span class="form-card-num">1</span>연락처</h2>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="name">이름</label>
            <input id="name" type="text" name="name" value="{{values.name}}" autocomplete="name" maxlength="50" required />
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="phone">연락처</label>
            <input id="phone" type="tel" name="phone" value="{{values.phone}}" inputmode="tel" autocomplete="tel" maxlength="20" placeholder="010-0000-0000" required />
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="address">주소</label>
            <input id="address" type="text" name="address" value="{{values.address}}" autocomplete="street-address" maxlength="200" placeholder="동 · 호수까지 적어주세요" required />
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="form-card">
          <h2 class="form-card-title"><span class="form-card-num">2</span>현장 사진</h2>
          <div class="field">
            <span class="field-label" id="photos-label">사진 <span class="required">필수</span></span>
            <label class="upload">
              <input type="file" name="photos" accept="image/*" multiple required data-kind="photo" data-min-count="1" data-max-count="20" data-max-size="10485760" aria-labelledby="photos-label" aria-describedby="photos-hint" />
              <span class="upload-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
              <span class="upload-text">
                <strong class="upload-title" data-default="사진 찍기 · 선택하기" data-again="사진 다시 선택하기">사진 찍기 · 선택하기</strong>
                <span class="upload-hint" id="photos-hint">1장 이상 · 최대 20장 · 장당 10MB</span>
              </span>
            </label>
            <p class="upload-summary" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
            <p class="upload-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
            <ul class="thumbs" hidden></ul>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <span class="field-label" id="video-label">동영상 <span class="optional">선택</span></span>
            <label class="upload">
              <input type="file" name="video" accept="video/*" data-kind="video" data-max-count="1" data-max-size="209715200" aria-labelledby="video-label" aria-describedby="video-hint" />
              <span class="upload-icon" aria-hidden="true">▶</span>
              <span class="upload-text">
                <strong class="upload-title" data-default="동영상 선택하기" data-again="동영상 다시 선택하기">동영상 선택하기</strong>
                <span class="upload-hint" id="video-hint">1분 이내 · 최대 200MB</span>
              </span>
            </label>
            <p class="upload-summary" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
            <p class="upload-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
            <ul class="thumbs" hidden></ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="form-card">
          <h2 class="form-card-title"><span class="form-card-num">3</span>추가 정보 <span class="optional">선택</span></h2>
          <fieldset class="field">
            <legend>발생 장소</legend>
            <div class="chips">
              <label class="chip"><input type="radio" name="location" value=""{{#unless values.location}} checked{{/unless}} /><span>선택 안 함</span></label>
              {{#each locations}}
                <label class="chip"><input type="radio" name="location" value="{{value}}"{{#if selected}} checked{{/if}} /><span>{{value}}</span></label>
              {{/each}}
            </div>
          </fieldset>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="description">상황 설명</label>
            <input id="description" type="text" name="description" value="{{values.description}}" maxlength="200" placeholder="예: 천장에서 물이 떨어지고 있어요" />
          </div>
        </section>

        <div class="submit-area">
          <button type="submit" id="submit-button" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg btn-block"><span aria-hidden="true">🚨</span> 긴급 출동 요청</button>
          <p class="submit-status" aria-live="polite" hidden>사진이 많으면 1~2분 걸릴 수 있어요. 창을 닫지 말고 기다려주세요.</p>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </main>

  {{> footer}}
  <script src="/app.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
